  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qi Zai tells a new Qi clan Gu Immortal that after his current matter is settled they can return to Qi Sea grotto-heaven, where seniors will welcome another clan Gu Immortal and the junior should live there for a time, observe carefully, and ask questions.",
      "chapters": [
        1035
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_zai",
        "fac_qi_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan orders Bai Ning Bing to bring him the heads of Qi clan’s Gu Immortals and their Qi Sea grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1641
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-xiang-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration states that Qi Sea grotto-heaven was Qi Xiang’s immortal aperture in the past. After it was placed in white heaven it could no longer move and stayed there. Fang Yuan uses that knowledge to set a formation near its entrance.",
      "chapters": [
        1642
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-xiang-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qi Ping Su, rank six, stays behind to guard Qi clan’s base, Qi Sea grotto-heaven. The grotto-heaven is huge, covered in white clouds, and has strong winds. Unlimited qi sea was left there after Qi Xiang died; without rank eight Gu Immortals in Qi clan the huge quantity of qi had gradually dissipated. When Fang Yuan moves on the grotto-heaven, Qi Sea heavenly spirit barely activates unlimited qi sea again. After the grotto-heaven is taken down, Qi Fa and Qi Cai surrender. Fang Yuan obtains Qi Sea grotto-heaven along with other Five Xiang’s Bet prizes.",
      "chapters": [
        1643
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance-and-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unlike grotto-heavens that annexed a nine heavens fragment, Qi clan’s Qi Sea grotto-heaven did not annex such a fragment and relied on unlimited qi sea to resist calamities and tribulations. Fang Yuan’s qi path attainment level still obstructs annexing it for a time.",
      "chapters": [
        1682
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "annexation-barrier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After he annexes it, the one million qi path dao marks from Qi Sea grotto-heaven influence every part of the sovereign immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1859
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-marks-after-annexing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration later groups it with Hei Fan grotto-heaven among seized grotto-heavens Fang Yuan manages inside the sovereign immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        2072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "among-seized-grotto-heavens",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    }
  ],
